{
  "title": "Acerca de Artefact UI",
  "content": [
    {
      "blockType": "stack",
      "direction": "vertical",
      "gap": "10",
      "padding": "1rem 1.5rem 3rem",
      "backgroundImage": "/media/hero-placeholder-dark.svg",
      "backgroundImageLight": "/media/hero-placeholder-light.svg",
      "backgroundFit": "cover",
      "fullBleed": true,
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "horizontal",
          "align": "center",
          "justify": "between",
          "gap": "4",
          "style": "max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;width:100%;flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:0.75rem",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "anchor",
              "href": "/",
              "variant": "plain",
              "style": "flex-shrink:0;font-weight:600",
              "children": [
                {
                  "blockType": "text",
                  "content": "Artefact UI",
                  "size": "lg"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blockType": "stack",
              "direction": "horizontal",
              "align": "center",
              "gap": "6",
              "style": "flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end;min-width:0",
              "children": [
                {
                  "blockType": "anchor",
                  "href": "/es/blog",
                  "variant": "plain",
                  "children": [{ "blockType": "text", "content": "Blog" }]
                },
                {
                  "blockType": "anchor",
                  "href": "/es/docs",
                  "variant": "plain",
                  "children": [{ "blockType": "text", "content": "Docs" }]
                },
                {
                  "blockType": "anchor",
                  "href": "/es/about",
                  "variant": "plain",
                  "children": [{ "blockType": "text", "content": "Acerca de" }]
                },
                {
                  "blockType": "dropdown",
                  "triggerIcon": "<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"></path>",
                  "triggerAriaLabel": "Idioma",
                  "triggerText": "ES",
                  "placement": "bottom-end",
                  "items": [
                    { "type": "item", "label": "English", "value": "en", "toggleLocale": "en" },
                    { "type": "item", "label": "中文", "value": "zh", "toggleLocale": "zh" },
                    { "type": "item", "label": "Español", "value": "es", "toggleLocale": "es" },
                    { "type": "item", "label": "Português", "value": "pt", "toggleLocale": "pt" },
                    { "type": "item", "label": "Français", "value": "fr", "toggleLocale": "fr" },
                    { "type": "item", "label": "Deutsch", "value": "de", "toggleLocale": "de" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "blockType": "anchor",
                  "href": "/admin",
                  "variant": "plain",
                  "class": "button button--variant_outline button--size_sm",
                  "children": [{ "blockType": "text", "content": "Admin" }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "align": "center",
          "gap": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "text": "Nuestra historia",
              "colorPalette": "purple",
              "size": "lg"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "heading",
              "text": "Construyendo el sistema de diseño que siempre quisimos",
              "size": "6xl",
              "as": "h1",
              "style": "text-align:center;max-width:44rem"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "size": "lg",
              "content": "Artefact UI es una biblioteca de componentes y un creador de páginas impulsado por CMS, creado por un pequeño equipo que se cansó de reconstruir las mismas bases desde cero en cada proyecto.",
              "style": "text-align:center;max-width:38rem"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockType": "grid",
      "gap": "8",
      "padding": "2.5rem 0",
      "style": "border-top: 1px solid var(--colors-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--colors-border)",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "align": "center",
          "gap": "2",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "heading",
              "text": "120+",
              "size": "6xl",
              "as": "p",
              "style": "text-align:center"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Componentes publicados",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "purple",
              "size": "md"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "align": "center",
          "gap": "2",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "heading",
              "text": "6",
              "size": "6xl",
              "as": "p",
              "style": "text-align:center"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Idiomas soportados",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "cyan",
              "size": "md"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "align": "center",
          "gap": "2",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "heading",
              "text": "2021",
              "size": "6xl",
              "as": "p",
              "style": "text-align:center"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Fundado",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "green",
              "size": "md"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "columns": "{\"base\": 1, \"md\": 3}"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "stack",
      "direction": "vertical",
      "gap": "4",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "padding": "2.5rem 2rem",
      "borderRadius": "1.25rem",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "badge",
          "variant": "subtle",
          "text": "Por qué existimos",
          "colorPalette": "purple",
          "size": "sm"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "heading",
          "text": "Nuestra misión",
          "size": "3xl",
          "as": "h2"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "text",
          "size": "lg",
          "content": "Creemos que los equipos avanzan más rápido cuando el diseño y la ingeniería comparten una única fuente de verdad. Artefact UI empareja una verdadera biblioteca de componentes con un creador de páginas que los no ingenieros pueden usar de forma segura, para que el sistema de diseño siga siendo el único lugar donde ocurren los cambios, en lugar de dispersarse en modificaciones puntuales."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockType": "stack",
      "direction": "vertical",
      "gap": "2",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "badge",
          "variant": "subtle",
          "text": "Principios",
          "colorPalette": "purple",
          "size": "sm"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "heading",
          "text": "Lo que valoramos",
          "size": "3xl",
          "as": "h2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockType": "grid",
      "gap": "6",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Accesible",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "green"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Accesible por defecto",
          "description": "El soporte para teclado y lectores de pantalla viene incluido en cada componente",
          "body": "Probamos con tecnología de asistencia real, no solo con auditorías automatizadas, para que la accesibilidad se mantenga en producción.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Componible",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "purple"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Componible por diseño",
          "description": "Piezas pequeñas que se combinan, no una gran configuración",
          "body": "Cada componente se construye con el mismo sistema de recetas, por lo que personalizar uno no significa luchar contra los demás.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "card",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "badge",
              "text": "Transparente",
              "variant": "subtle",
              "colorPalette": "cyan"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Abiertos sobre las concesiones",
          "description": "La documentación explica el porqué, no solo la API",
          "body": "Cuando algo es una concesión deliberada y no un error, lo decimos: en la documentación, no solo en el registro de cambios.",
          "imagePosition": "top",
          "variant": "elevated"
        }
      ],
      "columns": "{\"base\": 1, \"md\": 3}"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "stack",
      "direction": "vertical",
      "gap": "2",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "badge",
          "variant": "subtle",
          "text": "Quién está detrás",
          "colorPalette": "purple",
          "size": "sm"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "heading",
          "text": "El equipo",
          "size": "3xl",
          "as": "h2"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "text",
          "size": "lg",
          "content": "Un pequeño grupo que mantiene la biblioteca, la documentación y la integración con el CMS."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockType": "grid",
      "gap": "6",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "align": "center",
          "gap": "3",
          "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
          "borderRadius": "1rem",
          "borderWidth": "1px",
          "borderStyle": "solid",
          "borderColor": "default",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "avatar",
              "name": "Yumin Chen",
              "size": "2xl",
              "variant": "solid"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "heading",
              "text": "Yumin Chen",
              "size": "lg",
              "as": "p"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "size": "sm",
              "content": "Fundador y Mantenedor",
              "style": "color: var(--colors-fg-muted); font-weight: 600"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "size": "sm",
              "content": "Dirige la biblioteca de componentes y los tokens de diseño de Panda CSS.",
              "style": "color: var(--colors-fg-muted)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "align": "center",
          "gap": "3",
          "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
          "borderRadius": "1rem",
          "borderWidth": "1px",
          "borderStyle": "solid",
          "borderColor": "default",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "avatar",
              "name": "Jordan Lee",
              "size": "2xl",
              "variant": "solid"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "heading",
              "text": "Jordan Lee",
              "size": "lg",
              "as": "p"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "size": "sm",
              "content": "Ingeniero de Sistemas de Diseño",
              "style": "color: var(--colors-fg-muted); font-weight: 600"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "size": "sm",
              "content": "Responsable del creador de páginas del CMS y del registro de bloques que lo impulsa.",
              "style": "color: var(--colors-fg-muted)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "align": "center",
          "gap": "3",
          "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
          "borderRadius": "1rem",
          "borderWidth": "1px",
          "borderStyle": "solid",
          "borderColor": "default",
          "textAlign": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "avatar",
              "name": "Priya Nair",
              "size": "2xl",
              "variant": "solid"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "heading",
              "text": "Priya Nair",
              "size": "lg",
              "as": "p"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "size": "sm",
              "content": "Documentación y Accesibilidad",
              "style": "color: var(--colors-fg-muted); font-weight: 600"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "text",
              "size": "sm",
              "content": "Mantiene la documentación honesta y cada componente probado con lectores de pantalla.",
              "style": "color: var(--colors-fg-muted)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "columns": "{\"base\": 1, \"md\": 3}"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "stack",
      "direction": "vertical",
      "align": "center",
      "gap": "4",
      "backgroundColor": "#f5f3ff",
      "padding": "4rem 2rem",
      "borderRadius": "1.25rem",
      "children": [
        {
          "blockType": "heading",
          "text": "¿Quieres verlo en acción?",
          "size": "3xl",
          "as": "h2",
          "style": "text-align:center"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "text",
          "size": "lg",
          "content": "Explora la documentación de componentes o consulta una página de producto en vivo construida con los mismos bloques.",
          "style": "text-align:center"
        },
        {
          "blockType": "stack",
          "direction": "horizontal",
          "gap": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "blockType": "anchor",
              "children": [
                {
                  "blockType": "text",
                  "content": "Leer la documentación"
                }
              ],
              "href": "/es/docs",
              "variant": "solid",
              "class": "button button--variant_solid button--size_lg"
            },
            {
              "blockType": "anchor",
              "children": [
                {
                  "blockType": "text",
                  "content": "Ver página de ejemplo"
                }
              ],
              "href": "/product-landing",
              "variant": "outline",
              "class": "button button--variant_outline button--size_lg"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
